OL,3,GNEWSAWakefield Trinity bus parade: What
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FWakefield Trinity fans are invited to
OL,7,Fdescend on the city centre later for an
OL,8,Fopen-top bus parade, after the side
OL,9,Fwere crowned champions of the Super
OL,10,FLeague.
OL,12,FTrinity beat Warrington Wolves 23-10 in
OL,13,FSaturday night's Grand Final at Old
OL,14,FTrafford in Manchester.
OL,16,FIt marks their first title win since
OL,17,F1968, long before the Super League was
OL,18,Festablished.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
